# The build context of deploy/compose/ is the repo root: keep it small and free of local
# state. (api/Dockerfile, Render's, builds from api/ and has its own api/.dockerignore.)
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.uv-cache
**/.seed-cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.bak
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
api/uploads
uploads
reference
web/dist
web/openapi.json
playwright-report
test-results
e2e-evidence
allure-results
allure-report
